["20:53"]={"Only \003eight fifty-three\004. The partners’ decision meeting starts in seven minutes. I’m not sure I can bear this.","The Undomestic Goddess","Sophie Kinsella"},
["20:54"]={"I tried to restart our dinner-table conversation, which had been about the validity of I.Q. tests, but he was back in his funk again, and I didn’t feel like trying to jolly him out of it. I was relieved when the bell squawked at \003six minutes to nine\004; now maybe we’d get some action.","Death on Deadline","Robert Goldsborough"},
