["20:56"]={"“No. 7 berth—a second-class. The gentleman has not yet come, and it is \003four minutes to nine\004.”","Murder on the Orient Express","Agatha Christie"},
["20:57"]={"She points up at Watch that says 08:57, that’s \003only three minutes before nine\004. So I run into Wardrobe and lie down on my pillow and wrap up in Blanket that’s all grey and fleecy with the red piping.","Room","Emma Donoghue"},
["20:58"]={"What time is it? she asked, quiet, definite, hopeless.\n“\003Two minutes to nine\004,” he replied, telling the truth with a struggle.","Sons and Lovers","D.H. Lawrence"},
